# CORS Rules

Control browser origin access safely.

## Requirements
- Allowed origins must be explicit and environment-driven.
- Wildcard origins must not be combined with credentials.
- Staff and public origins may be separated when risk profiles differ.
- Only required headers and methods may be exposed.
- Preflight behavior must be deterministic and documented.
- CORS failures must not leak sensitive configuration.
